ES:
¿Sabes lo que se lleva ahora?
Tener {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
de mascota, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Necesito que me atrapes un{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F00020061000000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
¿Qué pensarán todos si no sigo
la moda?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Vale
No puedo

IT:
Mi hanno detto che
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
è l'insetto più in voga del momento!
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}DEVO averne un{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
Non posso restare indietro!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Puoi aiutarmi?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Certo!
Niente da fare.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Böcek yakalama konusunda profesyonelsin,
değil mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}boynuzlu böcek{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
beslemek ne kadar havalı olur diye
düşünüyordum.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Harika bir evcil hayvan
olmaz mı? {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Herhangi bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}boynuzlu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}böcek{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
olur. Ne dersin, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Benim
için bir tane yakalar mısın?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yaparım!
Üzgünüm, hayır.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}A te piace prendere insetti, vero?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Io vorrei tanto un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}coleottero{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Tutte le mie amiche ne hanno uno!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non posso essere la pecora nera
della comitiva.
Sai... mi va bene qualsiasi tipo
di coleottero, davvero!
Mi aiuti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ma certo!
Ehm... no.

FR:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} ! Il paraît que t'es
ceinture noire de canne à pêche ?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}J'ai commandé un aquarium, hi hi !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Et je compte y mettre {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} !
Vu que la pêche et moi, ça fait
quatre...{{TAG:0003:000D:}} tu veux bien m'en
attraper {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD040075006E00060075006E00650002003000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
J'y cours !
Tu fais erreur...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}You're really good at catching fish,
right, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Well, how about
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}river fish{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yeah, I totally need one of those.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I won't be picky about it, I swear.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Can you please get one for me?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
River fish? Sure!
Sorry, but no.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Mi dicono che sei appassionat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
di pesca, giusto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Allora
mi porteresti un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}pesce di fiume{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Qualsiasi tipo va bene!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Vedi, ho
fatto una scommessa con una mia
amica... Cioè, è una storia lunga!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Allora, puoi aiutarmi?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Faccio io!
Non posso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Balık yakalamakta gerçekten iyisin,
değil mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Peki {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}nehir balığı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
konusunda nasılsın?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evet, kesinlikle
bir tane lazım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Söz, seçici davranmayacağım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bana bir tane bulur musun lütfen?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Nehir balığı mı? Tabii!
Üzgünüm, hayır.
